            <ArticleTitle>Statins: where are we now?</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>789-92</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Statin therapy reduces the risk of cardiac events by 30% in both primary and secondary prevention. Although fine-tuning of the evidence will occur as more clinical trials report, the challenge is now to implement the evidence to the benefit of patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
